# Allow only image inputs. This also protects local build contexts.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!alembic.ini
!wsgi.py
!volleyball/
!volleyball/**
